 portions and/or varieties of seafood."]],"src":"wikipedia","actions":[{"kind":"globe","hash":"dish-ulmyeon"},{"kind":"wiki","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ulmyeon"}],"sections":[{"h":"Where it's from","links":[["Korean Chinese cuisine","cuisine/korean-chinese-cuisine"]]},{"h":"Ingredients","count":12,"links":[["Agaricus bisporus","ingredient/agaricus-bisporus"],["Broth","ingredient/broth"],["Carrot","ingredient/carrot"],["Cornstarch","ingredient/cornstarch"],["Cuttlefish","ingredient/cuttlefish"],["Egg","ingredient/egg"],["Noodle","ingredient/noodle"],["Noodles","ingredient/noodles"],["Sea cucumber","ingredient/sea-cucumber"],["Shiitake","ingredient/shiitake"],["Shrimp","ingredient/shrimp"],["Squid as food","ingredient/squid-as-food"]]},{"h":"Cook it","rows":[{"name":"Korean Bapsang","ref":"site/koreanbapsang-com","color":"#55b8ad","shape":"site","sub":"koreanbapsang.com","note":"Korean Bapsang's section on Korean Chinese dishes such as jjajangmyeon and jjamppong.","url":"https://www.koreanbapsang.com/category/korean-chinese","suggested":true,"kind":"blog"}]},{"h":"More from Korean Chinese cuisine","links":[["Hotteok","dish/hotteok"],["Jjajangmyeon","dish/jjajangmyeon"],["Jjamppong","dish/jjamppong"],["Jungguk-naengmyeon","dish/jungguk-naengmyeon"]]}],"img":{"src":"/labs/cuisines/img/thumb/d/d9/Ulmyeon.jpg/500px-Ulmyeon.jpg","w":500,"h":333,"by":"Galaxea","lic":"CC BY 4.0","licUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Ulmyeon.jpg"}},"cookbook/korean-temple-cooking-lessons-on-life-and-buddhism-with-recipes":{"t":"book","r":"cookbook/korean-temple-cooking-lessons-on-life-and-buddhism-with-recipes","n":"Korean Temple Cooking: Lessons on Life and Buddhism, with Recipes","c":"#f0b340","crumb":[["Cookbooks","cookbooks"]],"sub":"Cookbook by Hoo Nam Seelmann, 2025","square":true,"suggested":true,"isbn":"9781964786186","intro":[["Profile of Buddhist nun and temple cook Jeongkwan Snim, with her vegan temple recip